{"pageid": 313, "title": "House of Slaughter 3", "revid": 649, "categories": ["Comics", "House of Slaughter comics"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">House of Slaughter #3</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/06/House_of_Slaughter_3_Cover.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230226174604\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"House of Slaughter 3 Cover\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/06/House_of_Slaughter_3_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230226174604\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/06/House_of_Slaughter_3_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230226174604 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/06/House_of_Slaughter_3_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20230226174604 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"House of Slaughter 3 Cover\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"House_of_Slaughter_3_Cover.jpg\" data-image-name=\"House of Slaughter 3 Cover.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 22, 2021</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_2\" title=\"House of Slaughter 2\">House of Slaughter #2</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_4\" title=\"House of Slaughter 4\">House of Slaughter #4</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>House of Slaughter #3</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on December 22, 2021 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the third issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_(comic_series)\" title=\"House of Slaughter (comic series)\">House of Slaughter</a></i> comic series.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p>As the House leaders discuss the fate of \"the Last Butcher,\" <span class=\"new\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter (comics) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWFyb25fU2xhdWdodGVyXyhjb21pY3MpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Aaron</span> and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Jace Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSmFjZV9Cb3VjaGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Jace</span> escape the watchful eye of Helen and the White Masks and sneak into the forbidden outreaches of Chicago. Then, in the present-day, Aaron finally comes face-to-face with the monster that he's been tracking... which is much more powerful than expected.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Jace Boucher (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSmFjZV9Cb3VjaGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Jace Boucher</span></li>\n<li>Helen</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comic_guide\">Comic guide</span></h2>\n<table class=\"navbar mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Expand\" data-collapsetext=\"Collapse\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border: 1px solid #8c8c8c; background:transparent; border-radius:4px; text-align:center;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background: var(--theme-sticky-nav-background-color); border-radius:4px;\" align=\"left\"><div style=\"height:3px; margin:0px 0px 0px 3px\"><div style=\"font-size:8pt\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Comic_(HOS)\" title=\"Template:Comic (HOS)\">v</a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://something-is-killing-the-children.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Comic_(HOS)\">d</a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://something-is-killing-the-children.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Comic_(HOS)?veaction=editsource\">e</a></div></div> <center><a href=\"/wiki/Category:House_of_Slaughter_comics\" title=\"Category:House of Slaughter comics\"><font color=\"#E7F0DF\">Comic guide</font></a></center>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:var(--theme-sticky-nav-background-color); border-radius:4px;\"><font color=\"#E7F0DF\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Butcher%27s_Ma